# Facts of the playtest verdict family. The host reads a report (text or JSON ledger) into these typed facts; every threshold, marker word and ordering below is the rule.
# plane = the hand implementation judged today: server (Python _is_playtest_pass/_classify_outcome/suite_verdict) or editor (C# CommandRouter.IsPlaytestSuccess).
# Each plane has its own extractor that mirrors its own parser: Python finds the PLAYTEST header on any line (warnings are prepended before the report is read, MCP-GUARD-007) and reports first|later;
# C# accepts it only at the very start (first) with a count token ended by a space, and looks for no failure markers. Those parse differences live in the two extractors, not in rows; the owner has not chosen between the planes (Q-V1).
CONTRACT unitymcp.verdict
COVERAGE declared-scope
MODULE verdict_facts
FACT report.plane enum=server,editor closed
FACT report.format enum=json,text closed
FACT report.blank bool
FACT report.zeroOfZero bool
FACT ledger.readable bool
FACT ledger.teardownOk bool
FACT ledger.hasFailed bool
FACT ledger.failed number integer
FACT ledger.steps number min=0 max=1000000 integer
FACT ledger.stepsNotOk number min=0 max=1000000 integer
FACT ledger.failedMatchesSteps bool
FACT text.header enum=none,first,later closed
FACT text.passed number min=0 max=1000000 integer
FACT text.total number min=0 max=1000000 integer
FACT text.hasFail bool
FACT text.hasError bool
FACT text.hasConsoleErr bool
FACT text.hasBlocked bool
FACT text.hasTimeout bool
FACT text.hasAborted bool
FACT file.passed number min=0 max=1000000 integer
FACT file.expected number min=0 max=1000000 integer
FACT file.errorText bool
FACT suite.anyFail bool
FACT suite.anyError bool
FACT suite.allNoVerdict bool
FACT suite.outerFailed bool
LINK policy.passes passes
INPUT passes report.plane report.format report.blank ledger.teardownOk ledger.hasFailed ledger.failed ledger.steps ledger.stepsNotOk text.header text.passed text.total text.hasFail text.hasError text.hasConsoleErr text.hasBlocked text.hasTimeout text.hasAborted
INPUT outcome report.plane report.format report.blank report.zeroOfZero ledger.readable ledger.teardownOk ledger.hasFailed ledger.failed ledger.steps ledger.stepsNotOk ledger.failedMatchesSteps text.header text.passed text.total text.hasFail text.hasError text.hasConsoleErr text.hasBlocked text.hasTimeout text.hasAborted
INPUT fileState file.passed file.expected file.errorText
INPUT suiteInner suite.anyFail suite.anyError suite.allNoVerdict
INPUT suiteOuter suite.outerFailed
